              "BTTPredefinedActionType" : 195,
              "BTTPredefinedActionName" : "Run Apple Script (async in background)",
              "BTTInlineAppleScript" : "-- Runs alongside the real Cmd+V (sent by Karabiner). Never pastes anything itself.\n-- Image-only clipboard -> remote-paste --focused, which acts only if an Ultra tmux window has focus.\nset hasImage to false\nset hasText to false\ntry\n\trepeat with i in (clipboard info)\n\t\tset c to (item 1 of i) as text\n\t\tif c contains \"PNGf\" or c contains \"TIFF\" or c contains \"JPEG\" or c contains \"GIF\" then set hasImage to true\n\t\tif c is \"string\" or c is \"Unicode text\" or c contains \"utf8\" or c contains \"ut16\" then set hasText to true\n\tend repeat\nend try\nset go to (hasImage and (not hasText))\ndo shell script \"echo \\\"$(date '+%F %T') image=\" & hasImage & \" text=\" & hasText & \" ran_remote_paste=\" & go & \"\\\" >> $HOME/Library/Logs/warp-remote-paste.log\"\nif go then do shell script \"/Users/anshul/remote-paste --focused > /dev/null 2>&1 &\"\n",
              "BTTOrder" : 0
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
